ead \\(and can see again due to being dead\\), right click the door and hit close. It will close \\(It can be opened too\\).\r\n\r\nThe best thing to do would be to just check all verbs. Some already check stat \\(Pods' board verb checks it, for instance\\), but many don't.", "reported_by": "shadowlord13", "assigned_to": "zjm7891", "reported_by_id": "50ac4017e88f3d0bb0cafd25", "assigned_to_id": "517582b05fcbc9797b1170de", "status": "closed-fixed", "private": false, "discussion_disabled": false, "attachments": [], "custom_fields": {"_priority": "5", "_milestone": "Version 1.0 RC 2"}}}